00:08:14,430 --> 00:08:16,790
So it's fun to see them just throwing stuff all day.

106
00:08:18,720 --> 00:08:27,820
And to push X-Adapt even further, we designed these exoskeleton devices called DexUMI that has a one-to-one mechanical mapping to robot hands.

107
00:08:28,960 --> 00:08:35,100
And we use those exoskeleton to collect the data and we fine-tune GR00T only on that data.

108
00:08:35,500 --> 00:08:37,480
So this is fully autonomous.

109
00:08:38,500 --> 00:08:42,240
And yes, we do trust the robot with the knife.

