00:09:48,060 --> 00:09:51,560
And this also applies to whole body local manipulation.

124
00:09:52,020 --> 00:09:57,800
This part is same in Isaac Lab, and this is zero-shot transferring to real at our kitchen.

125
00:10:00,240 --> 00:10:07,120
And with X-Adapt meet grew to turbo paired with Sonic, the whole body controller that we introduced last year.

